cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use amos in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "amos: Automated Modeling for Open Scholarship"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that builds and runs reproducible data science workflows
  (cleaning, describing, splitting, preprocessing, modeling, evaluating, and
  drawing) from a plain settings file, designed for academic research.
